---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy policy | johwa" description="How johwa handles information collected through this website.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1 class="display">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated October 13, 2026.</p>
      <p>This page explains what information johwa ("we") collects through johwa.co, why we collect it, and how to reach us about it.</p>

      <h2>Information you send us</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the contact form, we receive your name, email address, and the message you write. We use it to reply to you.
        We don't sell it or share it for advertising. The form is delivered to us by an email service provider, which processes it
        on our behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not use analytics or advertising cookies.</p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare, which may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and pages requested) for security and performance.</p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>This site links to LinkedIn. Its privacy practices are its own.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us to see, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
